<%@ include file="fragments/head.jspf" %><section class="audience-page"><div class="audience-hero seller-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">For makers &#183; sellers</div><h1>Your craft, your story, your customer.</h1><p>A maker-first workspace for independent Tamil Nadu artisans to present their work, receive orders and keep customers updated.</p><a class="black-pill" href="/register/artisan">Create an artisan account <b>&#8594;</b></a><a class="story-text-link" href="/login/artisan">Already have an account? Sign in</a></div><div class="audience-art"><span>&#2965;&#3016;&#2997;&#3007;&#2985;&#3016;</span><small>MADE IN TAMIL NADU</small></div></div><div class="feature-list"><article><b>01</b><h2>Build a maker profile</h2><p>Share your shop name, craft, district and story. New profiles are reviewed by a marketplace administrator before listings go live.</p></article><article><b>02</b><h2>List with useful detail</h2><p>Add materials, technique, dimensions, price, stock and a product photo. Approved listings appear in the marketplace.</p></article><article><b>03</b><h2>Manage each order</h2><p>Accept paid or cash-on-delivery orders, record production milestones, and enter courier references and real shipment updates when available.</p></article><article><b>04</b><h2>See your earnings</h2><p>Paid online orders record the selling price, platform commission and artisan share in the maker earnings ledger.</p></article></div><div class="source-note">TN ARTISAN is an independent marketplace; profile approval is internal moderation and is not government certification. <a href="/mission">Read our mission &#8599;</a></div></section><%@ include file="fragments/foot.jspf" %>
